WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.090 --> 00:00:04.730
Hey youtubers it’s Charlie and this week
Orphan Black went a little No Country for

00:00:04.730 --> 00:00:11.910
Old Men, Mrs. S is not to be trusted and we
got a bunch more info about the Proletheans’

00:00:11.910 --> 00:00:13.840
Plans.

00:00:13.840 --> 00:00:17.270
If you’re finding me for the first time,
I’m doing weekly videos for season 2 of

00:00:17.270 --> 00:00:18.350
Orphan Black.

00:00:18.350 --> 00:00:22.230
Be sure to subscribe to get everything and
please ask as many questions as you can think

00:00:22.230 --> 00:00:23.230
of.

00:00:23.230 --> 00:00:28.020
Sometimes it can be hard to follow, but that’s
one of the things that makes it a lot of fun

00:00:28.020 --> 00:00:29.160
to talk about.

00:00:29.160 --> 00:00:32.119
So careful for spoilers from episode 2 if
you’re not caught up, but let’s start

00:00:32.119 --> 00:00:34.230
with top 5 moments and then I’ll do my review.

00:00:34.230 --> 00:00:36.649
Trust me, I have just as many questions as
you do.

00:00:36.649 --> 00:00:37.649
Here we go.

00:00:37.649 --> 00:00:39.940
Number 5 - Cosima Gets Her New Lab

00:00:39.940 --> 00:00:43.870
Of all the clones right now, I feel like Cosima
is doing the best job of being a spy or a

00:00:43.870 --> 00:00:45.980
double agent.

00:00:45.980 --> 00:00:51.630
Alison is just starting to deal with monitor
Donnie, but I think that will mostly be relationship

00:00:51.630 --> 00:00:52.630
comedy.

00:00:52.630 --> 00:00:55.770
I always get excited for Cosima lab scenes,
because that’s really where you learn a

00:00:55.770 --> 00:00:57.460
lot of Clone facts.

00:00:57.460 --> 00:01:01.559
Like being fertile or not fertile as is the
case with everyone except Sara.

00:01:01.559 --> 00:01:05.640
Did everyone see how much that upset Rachel?

00:01:05.640 --> 00:01:07.509
I can’t wait to learn more of her backstory.

00:01:07.509 --> 00:01:11.310
It looks like she’ll be working with Cosima
and Delphine, so I’m predicting their lab

00:01:11.310 --> 00:01:15.789
scenes in the next couple of episodes will
be my favorite, even if they’re not the

00:01:15.789 --> 00:01:16.789
biggest WTFs.

00:01:16.789 --> 00:01:20.530
I also thought it was interesting that Rachel
didn’t know Cosima was a lesbian.

00:01:20.530 --> 00:01:23.719
And let me know in the comments, what do you
think is actually the most interesting thing

00:01:23.719 --> 00:01:24.780
about her?

00:01:24.780 --> 00:01:26.649
Number 4 - Donnie is the monitor

00:01:26.649 --> 00:01:35.210
Kristian Bruun the actor had this interview
they played during one of the ads where he

00:01:35.210 --> 00:01:41.950
talked about how fun it was to play Donnie
as this silly husband character and getting

00:01:41.950 --> 00:01:44.459
to watch him do all these new Monitor spy
things was a huge plus for us, the audience,

00:01:44.459 --> 00:01:45.859
but not so much for Donnie himself.

00:01:45.859 --> 00:01:57.219
Any scene they end up doing inside this new
Mr and Mrs. Smith plotline will be totally

00:01:57.219 --> 00:02:03.229
hilarious, but now that Felix is bailing on
Alison and she feels so isolated.

00:02:03.229 --> 00:02:06.079
I feel like she’s going to do something
really really crazy.

00:02:06.079 --> 00:02:10.810
Like she’ll slowly lose her mind, snap and
do some Helena-Level damage after a few “shopping

00:02:10.810 --> 00:02:11.810
trips”.

00:02:11.810 --> 00:02:15.060
Remember, she’s the clone with access to
all the drugs and weapons.

00:02:15.060 --> 00:02:21.819
I wonder how long it will be before the fireworks
go off.

00:02:21.819 --> 00:02:24.329
Number 3 - Orphan Black Road Trip (felix/alison
separation too)

00:02:24.329 --> 00:02:29.960
So not only is Felix bailing on Alison, Sarah
and Kira can’t trust Mrs S and the Proletheans

00:02:29.960 --> 00:02:31.250
are involved now.

00:02:31.250 --> 00:02:37.159
So it’s like all the clones are slowly being
separated, like clone club is on hiatus temporarily.

00:02:37.159 --> 00:02:40.620
Based on the teaser it looks like they’re
headed for Cal’s house.

00:02:40.620 --> 00:02:45.030
The idea of the Proletheans being sciency
but old timey without a lot of tech kind of

00:02:45.030 --> 00:02:47.060
fits thematically with Cal’s character.

00:02:47.060 --> 00:02:53.450
So I guess Sarah is just going to spend a
lot of time camping in the woods this season.

00:02:53.450 --> 00:02:59.109
It’s super weird too, because the actor
who plays Cal also plays Daario on Game of

00:02:59.109 --> 00:03:04.549
Thrones right now and episode air so close
together it’s a little confusing in the

00:03:04.549 --> 00:03:11.290
fandom section of my brain.

00:03:11.290 --> 00:03:15.709
Number 2 - Mrs. S and the Birdwatchers
I love how much of a badass she was in the

00:03:15.709 --> 00:03:16.709
episode.

00:03:16.709 --> 00:03:20.209
It seemed like family turning on itself was
a big theme in the episode and turns out the

00:03:20.209 --> 00:03:26.019
Proletheans will pay big money to get their
hands on Kira.

00:03:26.019 --> 00:03:31.349
It seems like Mrs. S was being truthful when
she said I’ve always been on your side.

00:03:31.349 --> 00:03:38.219
But the big asterisk is that she’s not saying
which faction she really belongs too.

00:03:38.219 --> 00:03:41.450
It seems like she grew up with the Birdwatchers
but because they double crossed her, I’m

00:03:41.450 --> 00:03:46.920
calling Mrs. S like her own rogue faction
in between the Neolutionists and the Proletheans.

00:03:46.920 --> 00:03:50.010
It was pretty funny to think of her running
guns when she was Sarah’s age.

00:03:50.010 --> 00:03:53.220
Kind of like Sarah selling drugs to make money.

00:03:53.220 --> 00:03:58.599
The big takeaway is that Mrs S. knows people
in London that have answers about what’s

00:03:58.599 --> 00:04:00.269
going on with Kira’s biology.

00:04:00.269 --> 00:04:07.109
It’s like we went from having two factions
to four or more in the span of a few minutes.

00:04:07.109 --> 00:04:11.719
I feel like I need to start a flow chart to
keep track of everyone this season.

00:04:11.719 --> 00:04:14.249
Somebody feel free to paste a tumblr link
in the comments if you’re actually doing

00:04:14.249 --> 00:04:16.030
this.

00:04:16.030 --> 00:04:20.370
and my Number 1 moment - The Proletheans want
to breed Helena

00:04:20.370 --> 00:04:22.150
Hands down, creepiest moment in the episode.

00:04:22.150 --> 00:04:24.310
They didn’t explicitly say it.

00:04:24.310 --> 00:04:28.550
But during that whole No Country for Old Men
murder all that talk about Helena conceiving

00:04:28.550 --> 00:04:31.770
kind of foreshadowed their creepy cylon plan
to breed her.

00:04:31.770 --> 00:04:36.560
It reminds me of that one episode of Battlestar
called “The Farm” where Starbuck get’s

00:04:36.560 --> 00:04:41.419
captured by the cylon doctor who tries to
turn her into a baby making machine.

00:04:41.419 --> 00:04:45.430
It puts Helena in this really interesting
place, I think she’s going to be one of

00:04:45.430 --> 00:04:47.030
my favorite clones this year.

00:04:47.030 --> 00:04:51.639
Because she’s super crazy and yeah, she
killed a ton of people including her own clones.

00:04:51.639 --> 00:04:56.080
But now she’s being subjected to this creepy
cult, so I feel like we’re going to wind

00:04:56.080 --> 00:04:57.840
up empathizing with her.

00:04:57.840 --> 00:04:58.840
Let me know if you agree.

00:04:58.840 --> 00:05:03.340
Do you think that because of all this crazy
breeding talk, Helena is going to become a

00:05:03.340 --> 00:05:04.340
sympathetic character.

00:05:04.340 --> 00:05:07.720
She’ll stop being the villain of the show
and start being a victim?

00:05:07.720 --> 00:05:11.569
And be sure to let me know what your biggest
question is after this episode?

00:05:11.569 --> 00:05:14.800
I’m really wondering who those people in
London are.

00:05:14.800 --> 00:05:19.410
One of my favorite funny moments that didn’t
make my top five was Alison’s song, Blood

00:05:19.410 --> 00:05:20.410
Buddies.

00:05:20.410 --> 00:05:21.949
Let’s hope that one makes the DVD.

00:05:21.949 --> 00:05:26.729
Don’t you feel like if Alison doesn’t
get to perform the play full on this season,

00:05:26.729 --> 00:05:30.690
they should release it as a bonus feature?

00:05:30.690 --> 00:05:36.509
Overall I gave the episode a B plus, I loved
the characters, but some of the pacing felt

00:05:36.509 --> 00:05:37.509
uneven.

00:05:37.509 --> 00:05:40.169
Especially with everyone going in different
directions.

00:05:40.169 --> 00:05:44.699
Sometimes it can get a little confusing when
the different clones switch the energy they

00:05:44.699 --> 00:05:45.940
usually bring to scenes.

00:05:45.940 --> 00:05:50.800
Like Ailson is normally meant to be a comedian,
and Cosima is the rational brain of the group.

00:05:50.800 --> 00:05:56.039
So when Cosima starts being funny in a scene
next to Alison being funny it throws me off

00:05:56.039 --> 00:05:57.039
a little.

00:05:57.039 --> 00:06:01.720
And that kind of seems where everyone is headed.

00:06:01.720 --> 00:06:05.699
Clone Club did get new phones, so I’m expecting
a lot more conference calls.

00:06:05.699 --> 00:06:08.419
Since none of them are going to be in physical
proximity for a while.

00:06:08.419 --> 00:06:15.009
And eventually, based on what Mrs. S was saying,
Sarah is going to have to go to London eventually.

00:06:15.009 --> 00:06:20.949
Let me know if you agree that Sarah will end
up going there this season or if you think

00:06:20.949 --> 00:06:23.319
Mrs. S is going to bring someone from there
to Sarah.

00:06:23.319 --> 00:06:24.940
It’s like that saying.

00:06:24.940 --> 00:06:28.669
Brining Mohammed to the mountain versus bringing
the mountain to mohammed.

00:06:28.669 --> 00:06:31.759
We just don’t know who or what the mountain
is in this case.

00:06:31.759 --> 00:06:34.509
So next week I’ll post my episode 3 video
after the episode airs.

00:06:34.509 --> 00:06:35.669
Be sure to subscribe to get it.

00:06:35.669 --> 00:06:41.199
And don’t forget, tomorrow is new game of
thrones.

00:06:41.199 --> 00:06:44.919
Right now click here for my episode 1 video
and click here to catch up on game of thrones.

00:06:44.919 --> 00:06:46.770
Thanks for watching, see you guys tomorrow.

00:06:46.770 --> 00:06:47.300
High Fives!

